# region = Geofabrik .pbf URL. Mounted into the osm-extract init container.
# A new region is a one-line PR — no image rebuild.
#
# Geofabrik has no combined "benelux" extract — https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/
# only lists it as a directory (of the three countries below), not a .pbf; the old
# benelux= entry here 302'd to that HTML page instead of a real file (#368). Belgium,
# Netherlands and Luxembourg are separate curated regions instead.
#
# Approx first-boot cost (GraphHopper 11, graph + CH for car and moto):
#   belgium      no measured build yet — smaller than france, see logs for real numbers
#   netherlands  no measured build yet — smaller than france, see logs for real numbers
#   luxembourg   smallest Geofabrik extract, runs on a modest box in minutes
#   france       ~18 GB heap   ~50 min
#   germany      ~22 GB heap   ~65 min
# france and germany need a build machine with that much RAM until the prebuilt
# graphs land (sub-project 2).
belgium=https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/belgium-latest.osm.pbf
netherlands=https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/netherlands-latest.osm.pbf
luxembourg=https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/luxembourg-latest.osm.pbf
france=https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/france-latest.osm.pbf
germany=https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/germany-latest.osm.pbf
